Ascending with a third level character?

This is a response to a couple of thereads out there.  The first is the 
"how do you make NetHack more challenging?" thread.  My idea along these 
lines was to ascend with the lowest possible level.  Sort of a "so what! 
you were level 30 when you ascended but my character was so powerful that 
I managed to do it at level 3!" kind of mentality.

The second thread was the one a month or two back that asked about how 
you can gain and lose intrisic AC. (Sorry that I have no names here, I'm 
doing all this from memory.)

